---
description: One-line summary shown to the model in its skill listing
keywords: [words, that, trigger, auto-attach]
always: false
---

Files starting with "_" or "." are ignored — copy this template to
<skill_name>.md to create a real skill.

Write instructions the assistant should follow when this topic comes up.
Plain prose and bullets work best. Keep it under a screenful; it gets
attached to the conversation when a keyword matches, inlined into the
system prompt permanently if `always: true`, or fetched on demand via the
skill_read tool.
